 synthesizes evidence on the 'reasoning-answer hit gap' in Large Reasoning Models (LRMs). It details how alignment frameworks like MR-ALIGN can quantify state-transition probabilities within the thinking process to improve factual fidelity without external verifiers.", "title": "Detecting and Aligning Metareasoning Disconnects"}, {"id": "notebook-question-abandonment-001", "project": "proj-question-abandonment-01", "provenance": ["source-d7e5f607984e4bd2", "source-dd0a6ed315c24484"], "revision": 1, "summary": "This notebook synthesizes evidence on the structural conditions under which an intelligent system should abandon a research question. It establishes that abandonment is not merely a failure of persistence, but an epistemic necessity when the persistence of a structure (e.g., a research agenda) loses coherence against …", "title": "Epistemic Thresholds for Question Abandonment"}], "retrieval_triggers": ["material belief revision or retraction", "new contradiction or counterevidence", "high-consequence decision", "request for justification", "sign that an excerpt may hide a material distinction"]}}, "prev_hash": "f497e561093bd5799659487dd32adbd701cbfa44d3a7213824479362d0abae39", "hash": "c78ca2ca80e3e0bfe3375790932037a7131fbce2b4fa16deb9d8ca4057242323"}, {"seq": 2300, "time": "2026-10-28T12:18:07.730662+00:00", "kind": "provider_attempt_started", "payload": {"attempt": {"http_status": null, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider_input_chars": 47227, "provider_input_hash": "bd048de089f8ffcaf3732bb93ca03c4e38e60ca2e3f26066d10c1399bb352047", "result": "unknown"}, "id": "w-712bb9c99b2b4677"}, "prev_hash": "c78ca2ca80e3e0bfe3375790932037a7131fbce2b4fa16deb9d8ca4057242323", "hash": "a264ec8c9c4b0a4ef99b2fb935bb7eacf19c87ff7a459b61483adae4e022223e"}, {"seq": 2301, "time": "2026-10-28T12:18:41.970569+00:00", "kind": "provider_attempt_finished", "payload": {"attempt": {"http_status": null, "model": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "provider_call_made": false, "provider_inpu